<view class="page">
  <view class="intro">
    <text class="eyebrow">MY ACCOUNT</text>
    <text class="title">我的账号</text>
    <text class="copy">个人资料、校园范围、审核申请与三两豆都在这里管理。</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice success">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loggedIn}}" class="account-box">
    <text class="box-title">微信登录</text>
    <text class="copy">首次使用会建立账号。要关联已有资料，请先登录已验证邮箱账号再绑定微信。</text>
    <button class="primary" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="loginWechat">微信一键登录</button>
    <view class="divider">或绑定已有邮箱账号</view>
    <input placeholder="已验证的邮箱" value="{{bindEmail}}" bindinput="onEmail"/>
    <input placeholder="邮箱账号密码" password value="{{bindPassword}}" bindinput="onPassword"/>
    <button class="secondary" loading="{{binding}}" bindtap="bindExistingEmail">登录并绑定微信</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="account-box identity">
      <view><text class="box-title">已登录</text><text class="copy">{{email || '微信账号'}} · {{hasVerifiedEmail ? '已绑定验证邮箱' : '尚未绑定邮箱'}}</text></view>
      <button size="mini" class="text-button" bindtap="logout">退出</button>
    </view>
    <view class="account-box">
      <text class="box-title">个人资料</text>
      <text class="copy">学校与校区为用户自行填写，仅用于校园筛选，不是学校官方认证。</text>
      <input data-field="nickname" value="{{profile.nickname}}" placeholder="昵称" bindinput="onProfileInput"/>
      <input data-field="school" value="{{profile.school}}" placeholder="学校" bindinput="onProfileInput"/>
      <input data-field="campus" value="{{profile.campus}}" placeholder="当前校区（选填）" bindinput="onProfileInput"/>
      <input data-field="scheduleCompleteThrough" value="{{profile.scheduleCompleteThrough}}" placeholder="课表确认完整日期 YYYY-MM-DD" bindinput="onProfileInput"/>
      <input data-field="semesterEnd" value="{{profile.semesterEnd}}" placeholder="本学期结束日期 YYYY-MM-DD" bindinput="onProfileInput"/>
      <button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="saveProfile">保存资料</button>
    </view>
    <view class="account-box">
      <text class="box-title">三两豆 · 余额与获取方式</text>
      <view class="balances">
        <view><text>充值豆</text><text class="bean-value">{{wallet.purchased || 0}}</text><text class="copy">充值未开放</text></view>
        <view><text>贡献豆</text><text class="bean-value">{{wallet.contribution || 0}}</text><text class="copy">不提现、不转赠</text></view>
      </view>
      <text class="copy">充值和兑换暂未开放。资质齐备后再配置应用内数字权益目录与价格；贡献豆与充值豆分账，不换现金、不转赠。</text>
      <text wx:if="{{wallet.contributionDebt}}" class="debt">待抵扣 {{wallet.contributionDebt}} 个贡献豆，后续贡献奖励优先抵扣，不影响充值豆。</text>
      <view class="bean-rules">
        <text class="ledger-title">怎么获得贡献豆</text>
        <text class="copy">校园审核：邮箱验证、填写学校资料并经总管理员批准后，每完成 1 条审核且写明依据得 3 个贡献豆，每日最多计入 20 条。</text>
        <text class="copy">随机复核：每位审核员每月抽查约 10%。实质错判会说明理由后更正或重开；只追回未花掉的贡献豆，不足部分从以后审核奖励中抵扣。30 天内 2 次实质错判会提醒总管理员评估权限。</text>
        <text class="copy">反馈建议：内容通过安全检查后匿名公开；只有总管理员确认“已解决”并设置奖励，才发 0–20 个贡献豆，每条最多发放一次。提交建议本身不保证获奖。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="bean-ledger">
        <text class="ledger-title">最近变动</text>
        <view wx:if="{{!currencies.length}}" class="empty">暂时没有三两豆记录。</view>
        <view wx:for="{{currencies}}" wx:key="id" class="ledger-row">
          <view class="ledger-copy"><text class="ledger-entry">{{item.entryLabel}}</text><text class="copy">{{item.reason}} · {{item.createdLabel}}</text></view>
          <text class="ledger-amount {{item.amountTone}}">{{item.beanLabel}} {{item.amountLabel}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.debt_delta}}" class="debt">贡献奖励抵扣变化 {{item.debt_delta}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="account-box">
      <text class="box-title">申请成为校园审核员</text>
      <text wx:if="{{application}}" class="application-status">{{application.statusLabel}} · {{application.school}} {{application.campus}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{application && application.owner_note}}" class="copy">管理员说明：{{application.owner_note}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{application && application.applicant_response}}" class="copy">我已补充：{{application.applicant_response}}</text>
      <block wx:if="{{!application || application.status === 'declined' || application.status === 'withdrawn'}}">
        <block wx:if="{{hasVerifiedEmail}}">
          <text class="copy">申请需要已验证邮箱和学校资料，由总管理员同意后加入并设置审核范围。</text>
          <textarea maxlength="1000" placeholder="介绍熟悉的校园范围和申请理由（至少 10 字）" value="{{reviewerReason}}" bindinput="onReviewerReason"/>
          <button class="secondary" loading="{{applying}}" bindtap="applyReviewer">提交申请</button>
        </block>
        <text wx:else class="copy">请先绑定并验证一个现有邮箱账号。</text>
      </block>
      <block wx:if="{{application && application.status === 'pending' && application.owner_note}}">
        <text class="copy">管理员要求补充材料</text>
        <textarea maxlength="1000" placeholder="根据管理员要求补充说明或证明信息" value="{{applicantResponse}}" bindinput="onApplicantResponse"/>
        <button class="secondary" loading="{{replying}}" bindtap="replyToApplication">提交补充材料</button>
      </block>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>